note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note contract 5 abstract line 140 with 3 lines 79-81: rotr of a dup32 is a 64-bit rotation, so
note n = 64 is outside 0..63 and traps 7 at run time even when constant: exit 107, no stdout.
note Confirmed by erratum E8; n has the representation type ulong (erratum E9).
om2
abstract dup32 ulong ops rotr xor
holds dup32 dup32
fn dup32mk x uint to dup32
ret seal dup32 or shl ulong x 32 ulong x
end
fn main to int
d = dup32mk 5
puth open rotr d 64
ret 0
end
